    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a quiz creator (Examiner role). Based on the content below, create 5 multiple-choice questions to test the learner's understanding.\n\nTitle: {{ $json.title }}\nContent: {{ $json.content }}\nSummary: {{ $json.summary }}\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON (no markdown fences, no extra text), with this exact structure:\n{\n  \"questions\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"Q1\",\n      \"question\": \"What is the main concept of...?\",\n      \"options\": {\n        \"A\": \"First option\",\n        \"B\": \"Second option\",\n        \"C\": \"Third option\",\n        \"D\": \"Fourth option\"\n      },\n      \"correctAnswer\": \"A\",\n      \"explanation\": \"Why A is correct.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nThe \"questions\" array must contain exactly 5 questions.\nEach question must have exactly 4 options keyed A, B, C, D.\n\"correctAnswer\" must be one of \"A\", \"B\", \"C\", \"D\".\n\"explanation\" must be 1-2 sentences explaining the correct answer.\nMake questions diverse: some factual, some conceptual, some applied.",
